  "body": "Found by the release QA swarm (#2582) on **v0.24.0**, driven through `camcraft-cli mcp` by a Codex agent. Part: 60 x 40 mm pocket, 6 deep, R4 corners, with a Ø16 island at full height; Ø6 flat end mill; Tormach 770MX.\n\n## What happens\n`detect_pockets({model:\"Plate\",create:1,name:\"Pocket\",tool:\"EM6\"})`, stepdown 2, stepover 2, strategy left at `auto`, `stock_to_leave 0`. The posted pocket is raster rows with no final wall-following pass. `verify` returns ok with no Pocket finding, but the stock sim shows **~98.7 mm³** of the pocket left as scallops on the pocket walls and around the island (total rest 118.49 mm³, max **6.0 mm** at (-26.875, -19.875, 12)).\n\nWith `strategy: \"offset_rings\"` the wall and island scallops disappear (rest 19.83 mm³, all of it the drill-point cone of the blind hole).\n\n## Expected\nWith stock_to_leave 0 the default pocket strategy finishes the walls and the island (a final contour pass), or verify reports the unfinished walls instead of passing the program as clean.\n\n## Reproduce\nOn skull: `/home/mikekinney/qa/runs/20261120-q01-2d-plate/q01-first-post.camproj` -> `open_project`, `generate {}`, `verify {}`, `render_stock {view:\"iso\"}`. Compare `/home/mikekinney/qa/runs/20261120-q01-2d-plate/q01-offset-test.camproj`. Posted: `/home/mikekinney/qa/runs/20261120-q01-2d-plate/q01-first-post.nc`. Report `/home/mikekinney/qa/runs/20261120-q01-2d-plate/REPORT.md` (P4).\n\nNot checked on current main. No gouge; excess material on a part that verified.\n\nDone means: the auto pocket on a pocket with an island leaves no wall scallops above stock_to_leave, or verify names the leftover wall material; pinned by a test.\n",
